</pre></div><p><strong>Explanation:</strong></p><p>Here, we are given a dictionary. We used the pop() method to remove the specified key. We have also mentioned the default value to be returned in case the specified key is not present in the dictionary. As a result, the default value is returned.</p><h3 class="h3">Example: Another Simple Example of the Dictionary pop() Method</h3><p>Let us take a look at another example of the dictionary pop() method to understand how the default value parameter works.</p><div class="codeblock"><textarea class="python" name="code"># simple example of Python dictionary pop() method  
  
